<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Integrated, Natl Semi.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Integrated, Natl Semi.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Gruntal &amp; Co said in research notes that it raised its recommendation on National Semiconductor Corp to strong buy from outperform and raised Integrated Device Technology Inc to outperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Also, Gruntal raised it earnings estimates on Integrated Device Technology to $0.50 per share from $0.30 in 1998 and established a 1999 earnings estimate of $1.20 per share.  </p>
<p>((- Wall Street Desk, 212-859-1730)).</p>
</text>
